    uid=g40:38_130 heading "Release roadmap" level="2"
    uid=g40:38_131 StaticText "Milestone completion requires all tasks and integration proof. Two landed tasks do not qualify U01a or foundation-ready."
    uid=g40:38_132 heading "S1 · Prove the local-first center" level="3"
    uid=g40:38_133 DisclosureTriangle "U01a Establish repository contracts and test-first gates - IN PROGRESS" expandable expanded focusable focused
    uid=g40:39_0 StaticText "An engineer can build a small contract fixture, observe a real red/green test, reject a forbidden import, and compile the same wire values in TypeScript and Swift."
    uid=g40:39_1 StaticText "Qualification not complete. "
    uid=g40:39_2 link "Authoritative milestone and ten integration lanes" url="http://127.0.0.1:48763/source/docs/implementation-plan.md.html"
      uid=g40:39_3 StaticText "Authoritative milestone and ten integration lanes"
    uid=g40:38_134 DisclosureTriangle "U01b Qualify isolated verification and trusted evidence + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_135 DisclosureTriangle "U01c Prove independently recoverable backup and restore + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_136 DisclosureTriangle "U01d Qualify the selected React production client + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_137 DisclosureTriangle "U02 Invite developers into scoped project rooms + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_138 DisclosureTriangle "U03 Deliver durable conversation and ordered reconnection + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_139 DisclosureTriangle "U04 Answer questions with visible read-only agent sessions + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_140 DisclosureTriangle "U05 Create owned tasks with fenced runs and approvals + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_141 DisclosureTriangle "U06 Connect owner-bound workers and prepare clean worktrees + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_142 DisclosureTriangle "U07 Execute bounded local work and collect behavior evidence + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_143 DisclosureTriangle "U08 Publish approved drafts and enforce independent review + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_144 DisclosureTriangle "U09 Prove the first release across two accounts and machines + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_145 heading "S2 · Extend execution and clients" level="3"
    uid=g40:38_146 DisclosureTriangle "U10 Provision a private project from a conversation + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_147 DisclosureTriangle "U11 Build and qualify declarative project images + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_148 DisclosureTriangle "U12 Execute and recover one isolated cloud attempt + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_149 DisclosureTriangle "U13 Activate persistent project agents and reviewed knowledge + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_150 DisclosureTriangle "U14 Prove local and cloud execution parity + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_151 DisclosureTriangle "U18 Qualify a real external coding-agent adapter + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_152 DisclosureTriangle "U19 Deliver the native Swift client without worker authority + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_153 heading "S3 · Learn carefully, operate durably" level="3"
    uid=g40:38_154 DisclosureTriangle "U15 Capture observer proposals and promote reviewed knowledge + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_155 DisclosureTriangle "U16 Harden operations and prove governed deletion + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_156 DisclosureTriangle "U17 Add an opt-in notification-only Slack bridge + NOT STARTED" expandable
    uid=g40:38_157 heading "Durable truth versus working memory" level="2"
    uid=g40:38_158 StaticText "HOW IT WORKS · READ IN ORDER"
    uid=g40:38_159 StaticText "PostgreSQL and artifacts"
    uid=g40:38_160 StaticText "Intended durable record: conversations, decisions, state, receipts and immutable proof. Only a database fixture exists today."
    uid=g40:38_161 StaticText "Compiled context"
    uid=g40:38_162 StaticText "An authorized, bounded selection of exact revisions. Planned S1, not an agent's private memory."
    uid=g40:38_163 StaticText "Worker disk and model context"
    uid=g40:38_164 StaticText "Disposable execution and temporary reasoning input. Neither becomes project truth."
    uid=g40:38_165 StaticText "Reviewed knowledge"
    uid=g40:38_166 StaticText "Human-activated claims in S2; observer proposals in S3. No automatic policy rewrite."
    uid=g40:38_167 StaticText "See "
    uid=g40:38_168 link "data, memory and agent-isolation boundaries in R04/R13" url="http://127.0.0.1:48763/source/docs/technical-spec.md.html"
      uid=g40:38_169 StaticText "data, memory and agent-isolation boundaries in R04/R13"
    uid=g40:38_170 StaticText ". "
    uid=g40:38_171 link "The mirrored Markdown atlas" url="http://127.0.0.1:48763/source/docs/site/progress.md.html"
      uid=g40:38_172 StaticText "The mirrored Markdown atlas"
    uid=g40:38_173 StaticText " is generated from the same data owner, not maintained separately."
    uid=g40:38_174 heading "Deferred is not next" level="2"
    uid=g40:38_175 StaticText "Native macOS coding runners, private direct messages, browser IDEs, embeddings, multi-tenant hosting and automatic publication are outside this queue. Automatic merge and production execution are not authorized at all. Promotion needs the specific trigger and a new review in "
    uid=g40:38_176 link "R20" url="http://127.0.0.1:48763/source/docs/technical-spec.md.html"
      uid=g40:38_177 StaticText "R20"
    uid=g40:38_178 StaticText ", not a status edit."
    uid=g40:38_179 heading "How to read the sources" level="2"
    uid=g40:38_180 StaticText "The specification and plan retain their original design-baseline language, including historical statements that implementation had not started. This atlas reports the cited later code snapshot. Historical task receipts may still say review pending; they are linked as evidence of scope, not rewritten as milestone approval. Client isolation is marked active from task steering; its code is not present at this base revision."
    uid=g40:38_181 StaticText "The documentation task itself is "
    uid=g40:38_182 StaticText "In progress"
    uid=g40:38_183 StaticText " here because this artifact deliberately describes its own build snapshot. A later committed update can advance it after independent review. "
    uid=g40:38_184 link "Status update instructions" url="http://127.0.0.1:48763/authoring.html"
      uid=g40:38_185 StaticText "Status update instructions"
    uid=g40:38_186 StaticText " explain how to change the data and regenerate both views."
    uid=g40:38_187 link "Improve this page" url="http://127.0.0.1:48763/authoring.html"
      uid=g40:38_188 StaticText "Improve this page"
    uid=g40:38_189 StaticText "Documentation is part of implementation."
